  "prefLabel": "Ins 210.02 Manner for Adoption",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 210.02 Manner for Adoption.\n\n(a) The department shall commence rulemaking by drafting a proposed rule or by accepting as a proposed rule the draft of a rule proposed by any person pursuant to Ins 209 and Ins 210.03.\n\n(b) With respect to any proposed rule, the department shall conduct rulemaking and adoption proceedings pursuant to RSA 541-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 200) #13073-A, eff 7-27-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins200.html"
